<title>USA: Emerson Radio raises Sport Supply offer.</title>
<headline>Emerson Radio raises Sport Supply offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sport Supply Group Inc said Tuesday Emerson Radio Corp offered to buy 1.7 million shares of newly issued stock at $7 a share, in a revision of an earlier proposal.</p>
<p>A source at Emerson Radio said the consumer electronics company expected to issue a 13D for the revised offer Wednesday.</p>
<p>Emerson had previously offered to buy 1.33 million shares at $6 a share.</p>
<p>Sport Supply stock was trading at 6-1/4, off 3/8, at 1320 EST/1820 GMT Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sport Supply, a direct marketer of sporting equipment, said the fresh proposal also included the issuance of warrants to Emerson to purchase one million shares of additional stock at $7.50 a share.</p>
</text>
